<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>PiPBar</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>总开关</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>画中画增强：外框 + 底部控制条（roothide / iOS 16）。改任意项立即生效，无需注销。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用 PiPBar</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>总开关。关闭后画中画恢复原样。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外观（壳包在视频外面：顶/左右同宽，底部加宽）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowFrame</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示外框</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowProgress</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>可拖动进度条</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>底部黑边上的进度条，按住可拖动定位（系统画中画不能拖进度）。拖动时显示时间。直播流无总时长时不显示。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FreeMove</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>长按解除吸附</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>长按画面可切换「自由摆放」：解除系统把画中画钉在屏幕边缘的吸附，之后可随意拖动、双指缩放。再长按恢复系统吸附。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ExtendHit</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>扩展按钮命中区</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>开启后把画中画窗口的命中区扩展到外框（含底部黑边），这样按钮才能真正放到黑边上并点击。关闭则按钮被强制拉回视频内侧。异常时可关闭。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FrameWidth</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外框宽度</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>24</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>8</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>视频顶部与左右两侧黑边的厚度，0 = 不显示边框。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>BarHeight</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>底部高度</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>28</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>40</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>视频下方黑边（可拖动进度条所在处）的厚度。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SkipSeconds</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>快进/快退步长（秒）</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>5</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>60</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>10</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>点按画中画左半区快退、右半区快进该步长（秒）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>手势（切上/下一集）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>EpisodeSwipe</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>单指上下滑切集</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>单指在画中画上向上滑=下一集、向下滑=上一集（发 MR 下一集/上一集命令）。智能分流：仅当 App 上报了播放列表时才接管竖向滑动并切集；App 无播放列表（如抖音/B站单视频）时不接管、也不发无效命令，竖滑照旧用于移动窗口。自由态（长按后）、拖进度条时不触发。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DoubleTapRestore</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>双击还原全屏</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>在画中画外框（顶/左右边框）或底部黑边上快速点两下 = 系统控制条里的「还原」按钮：画中画收起、App 回前台全屏续播（进度接着走）。走 Pegasus 系统通道，不依赖 App 配合，抖音/B站这类也有效。生效区只限外框 + 底部黑边；视频画面内双击只触发快进/快退（不还原），且单击快进/快退即时生效、无延迟。正中间与顶部三分之一留给了系统原生控制，双击不接管。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FrameColor</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外框颜色（0=白 1=黑 2=青）</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>2</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>外框填充色：白 / 黑 / 主题青。拖动取整（0、1、2）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FrameOpacity</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外框不透明度（%）</string>
			<key>height</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>10</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>100</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>55</real>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>外框填充的不透明度，百分数。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>日志（排障用）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FileLog</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>日志总开关（syslog + 文件）</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>默认开启。关闭后 PiPBar 彻底静默：不再往系统日志（syslog）写任何内容，也不再写 /var/mobile/Library/Logs/PiPBar.log（Filza 直接翻，超 256KB 自动清空重记）。仅保留每次注销时 1 行 build 横幅，用来确认当前装的哪个版本。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.zlhkf.pipbar</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DebugLog</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>调试日志（视图层级 HIER）</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>footnote</key>
			<string>转储画中画的视图层级，量很大，仅排障时开。需要上面「日志总开关」也打开才生效。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
